The fundamental problem: a single parabolic arc has ONE sign change (or 0 if it's all downward/upward). For multiple arcs in a single tracklet, we need 2 sign changes per arc. So a long tracklet with 4 bounces has 8 sign changes. But the smoothing destroys those.

