+"""H14 sensitivity grid: sweep V_DEEP/V_SHALLOW thresholds and report counts.
+
+Output: number of BALLISTIC edges classified as V_DEEP, V_SHALLOW, FLAT
+        for each (min_d, ratio) combination.
