For 27→28: src_vy=-3.7 (downward, OK), tgt_vy=-9.4 (downward — ball is already falling again, NOT just thrown up). This is the signal: a real catch-throw's tgt_vy should be small (just leaving hand) or upward (just thrown up). A tracklet break's tgt_vy is a continuation of ballistic motion.

