30→33 (real catch-throw, V_SHALLOW):
- t30 source tail: at (707, 444) → (711, 473) — falling near left hand (L=58-66)
- t33 target head: starts at (714, 515) → (718, 547) — falling near right hand (R=64-80) AND moving closer to right hand
