- Settings 1-4 (radius 75-100, min_frames 3, pad 10): 100% recall but admits the FP (27→28) — F1=0.67
- Settings 5-10 (radius 20, min_frames 3): 100% precision but misses 30→33 — F1=0.67

Both extremes have F1=0.67 because we only have 2 REAL cases. The 30→33 case has no detector evidence at the hand, and the 27→28 case has tracker-tail low-conf dets that can't be filtered out without knowing the full tracker state. There's no operating point that achieves both 100% precision and 100% recall on this small sample.

