+|---|---|---|---|
+| v4d_rejected | 2 | 1 (50.0%) | 1 (50.0%) |
+| e6c_not_in_h7v2 | 42 | 16 (38.1%) | **26 (61.9%)** |
+| adjacent | 107 | 19 (17.8%) | 88 (82.2%) |
