+| f=339-374 (YouTube) | 0.649 | NO | CASCADE (real) | ✓ correct keep |
+| f=800-861 (YouTube) | 0.637 | NO | MIXED (real) | ✓ correct keep |
+
+**H43 precision: 1/1 = 100% (no over-rejects)**
+**H43 recall: 1/2 = 50% (missed 1 OTHER phase)**
+
