+#!/usr/bin/env python3
+"""H49: measure 10-frame filter's impact on per-frame H12 v8 pattern.
+
+HYPOTHESIS:
+  H47 applied the 10-frame filter to H12 v8's event log and
+  found it drops 3/48 events on identical. H48 confirmed
