+
+H55 v2's linear penalty (q_v11 = q_v10 - w54 * g_cv, gated by
+n_arcs_clean >= 3) over-penalizes chains with mid-range g_cv that
+are visually confirmed single-balls (e.g., chain 30 with g_cv=0.417,
