+- If n_arcs_clean >= 2 AND g_cv >= 1.0: apply partial penalty
+  (PARTIAL_W54=0.15 with linear ramp from 0 at g_cv=1.0 to 0.15 at g_cv=1.5)
+- Else: no penalty
+
+**Key result:** No CONFIDENT chains are demoted. The CONFIDENT count
