BiTrack stands out as the most novel and most directly relevant idea. The H7 min-cost flow is purely feed-forward (greedy forward). An offline bidirectional smoother (forward Kalman predict + backward Kalman smooth + RTS-style merge) is a completely new direction. Let me extract its core idea and then plan H59.
