Now I have a complete and well-structured evaluation. Some key findings:

1. Final operating point precision = 0.981, recall = 0.718 on the 113 reviewed pairs.
2. CONFIDENT chains are 100% precise (2/2) — confirms the H10 v11 v3 quality is a real signal.
3. H1 v4d alone: precision 1.000, recall 1.000 but only 2 pairs — these are the hand-only pairs in the labels.
4. YouTube is much better than identical: precision 1.000/recall 0.923 vs identical 0.964/0.600.
5. CONFIDENT + UNCERTAIN chains are 100% precise (38/0) — only the 13 LOW quality chains have 1 FP.
6. 20 FN on identical — the recall gap is mostly identical, not YouTube.

